<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Contacto | Metal-Ce S.R.L.</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://stackpath.bootstrapcdn.com/bootstrap/4.5.2/css/bootstrap.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/navBar.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/5.15.3/css/all.min.css">
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/sweetalert2@11"></script>
    <style>
        :root {
            --contact-ink: #21171a;
            --contact-muted: #74686d;
            --contact-line: rgba(139, 21, 56, .14);
            --contact-primary: #8B1538;
            --contact-primary-2: #A91D47;
            --contact-cream: #fff8f2;
            --contact-paper: #ffffff;
        }

        body.contact-page {
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at 8% 12%, rgba(169, 29, 71, .12), transparent 34%),
                linear-gradient(180deg, #fff8f4 0%, #f7f1f3 46%, #ffffff 100%);
            color: var(--contact-ink);
        }

        .contact-shell {
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .contact-hero {
            position: relative;
            min-height: 360px;
            padding: 76px 20px 140px;
            background:
                linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(70, 10, 28, .96), rgba(139, 21, 56, .94) 52%, rgba(177, 38, 80, .92)),
                url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg width='72' height='72' viewBox='0 0 72 72' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cg fill='none' stroke='%23ffffff' stroke-opacity='.08' stroke-width='1'%3E%3Cpath d='M12 36h48M36 12v48'/%3E%3Ccircle cx='36' cy='36' r='3' fill='%23ffffff' fill-opacity='.1' stroke='none'/%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E");
            color: #fff;
        }

        .contact-hero::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            right: clamp(-120px, -6vw, -30px);
            bottom: -160px;
            width: min(520px, 78vw);
            aspect-ratio: 1;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .22);
            border-radius: 50%;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 42px rgba(255, 255, 255, .035), inset 0 0 0 86px rgba(255, 255, 255, .025);
        }

        .contact-hero-inner {
            width: min(1120px, 100%);
            margin: 0 auto;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 330px;
            gap: 42px;
            align-items: end;
        }

        .contact-kicker {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            padding: 9px 14px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .22);
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .1);
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .92);
            font-size: .78rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: .14em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        .contact-hero h1 {
            margin: 22px 0 14px;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5.5vw, 5rem);
            font-weight: 900;
            line-height: .92;
            letter-spacing: -.07em;
            text-wrap: balance;
        }

        .contact-hero p {
            max-width: 660px;
            margin: 0;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .86);
            font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.6vw, 1.25rem);
            line-height: 1.65;
        }

        .contact-hero-card {
            padding: 24px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .2);
            border-radius: 26px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .11);
            box-shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, .22);
            backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
        }

        .contact-hero-card strong {
            display: block;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .contact-hero-card span {
            display: block;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .78);
            line-height: 1.55;
            font-size: .95rem;
        }

        .contact-layout {
            width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 32px));
            margin: -92px auto 70px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 360px;
            gap: 24px;
            align-items: start;
        }

        .form-card,
        .contact-aside {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .92);
            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 21, 56, .1);
            border-radius: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 26px 80px rgba(62, 18, 32, .13);
            backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
        }

        .form-card {
            padding: clamp(26px, 4vw, 46px);
        }

        .contact-form-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 18px 22px;
        }

        .form-section-title {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin: 0 0 20px;
            color: var(--contact-primary);
            font-size: 1.08rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: -.02em;
        }

        .form-section-title::after {
            content: '';
            flex: 1;
            height: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(139, 21, 56, .24), transparent);
        }

        .consult-section-title {
            margin-top: 34px;
        }

        .contact-field-full {
            grid-column: 1 / -1;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin: 0;
        }

        .form-group label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 9px;
            color: var(--contact-ink);
            font-size: .9rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: .01em;
        }

        .required-star {
            color: var(--contact-primary-2);
        }

        .form-card .form-control {
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            min-height: 54px;
            padding: 14px 16px;
            border: 1.5px solid #eadfe3;
            border-radius: 16px;
            background: #fff;
            color: var(--contact-ink);
            font-size: .98rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            line-height: 1.35;
            box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, .9), 0 8px 20px rgba(139, 21, 56, .035);
            transition: border-color .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease, transform .2s ease;
        }

        .form-card select.form-control {
            min-height: 56px;
            padding-right: 42px;
            appearance: auto;
        }

        .form-card textarea.form-control {
            min-height: 150px;
            resize: vertical;
        }

        .form-card .form-control::placeholder {
            color: #8c8186;
        }

        .form-card .form-control:focus {
            border-color: var(--contact-primary);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(139, 21, 56, .12), 0 12px 26px rgba(139, 21, 56, .08);
            outline: none;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        .required-note {
            margin: 18px 0 20px;
            color: #8b8085;
            font-size: .86rem;
        }

        .btn-submit {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            width: 100%;
            min-height: 58px;
            padding: 16px 22px;
            border: 0;
            border-radius: 18px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--contact-primary), var(--contact-primary-2));
            color: #fff;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 1.04rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: .01em;
            box-shadow: 0 18px 36px rgba(139, 21, 56, .3);
            transition: transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease, filter .2s ease;
        }

        .btn-submit:hover,
        .btn-submit:focus {
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            filter: saturate(1.08);
            box-shadow: 0 24px 42px rgba(139, 21, 56, .38);
        }

        .alert-custom-success,
        .alert-custom-error {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            padding: 18px 20px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            line-height: 1.45;
        }

        .alert-custom-success {
            background: #effdf5;
            border: 1px solid #a7f3c4;
            color: #17643a;
        }

        .alert-custom-error {
            background: #fff1f2;
            border: 1px solid #fecdd3;
            color: #981b2f;
        }

        .alert-custom-success i,
        .alert-custom-error i {
            margin-top: 3px;
            font-size: 1.35rem;
        }

        .contact-aside {
            position: sticky;
            top: 96px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .contact-aside-head {
            padding: 28px 28px 24px;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(255, 255, 255, .18), transparent 48%),
                linear-gradient(145deg, #2a1018, #8B1538);
            color: #fff;
        }

        .contact-aside-head span {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            color: #ffdbe6;
            font-size: .75rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: .16em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .contact-aside-head h2 {
            margin: 0 0 10px;
            font-size: 1.55rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            line-height: 1.12;
            letter-spacing: -.04em;
        }

        .contact-aside-head p {
            margin: 0;
            color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .78);
            font-size: .92rem;
            line-height: 1.55;
        }

        .contact-info-list {
            display: grid;
            gap: 0;
            padding: 8px 22px 24px;
        }

        .info-pill {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 42px minmax(0, 1fr);
            gap: 14px;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 18px 4px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--contact-line);
        }

        .info-pill:last-child {
            border-bottom: 0;
        }

        .info-pill i {
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            width: 42px;
            height: 42px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: #fff2f6;
            color: var(--contact-primary);
            font-size: 1.08rem;
        }

        .info-pill strong {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 3px;
            color: var(--contact-ink);
            font-size: .92rem;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        .info-pill span,
        .info-pill a {
            color: var(--contact-muted);
            font-size: .88rem;
            line-height: 1.45;
            overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        }

        .info-pill a {
            color: var(--contact-primary);
            font-weight: 800;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .contact-proof {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 10px;
            width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 32px));
            margin: -38px auto 54px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 3;
        }

        .contact-proof-item {
            padding: 16px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 21, 56, .1);
            border-radius: 20px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .9);
            box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(62, 18, 32, .08);
        }

        .contact-proof-item strong {
            display: block;
            color: var(--contact-primary);
            font-size: .96rem;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        .contact-proof-item span {
            display: block;
            margin-top: 4px;
            color: var(--contact-muted);
            font-size: .82rem;
        }

        .success-actions {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 991px) {
            .contact-hero {
                padding: 58px 18px 118px;
            }

            .contact-hero-inner,
            .contact-layout {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .contact-hero-card {
                max-width: 540px;
            }

            .contact-aside {
                position: static;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            .contact-hero {
                min-height: auto;
                padding: 42px 16px 94px;
            }

            .contact-kicker {
                font-size: .68rem;
                letter-spacing: .1em;
            }

            .contact-hero h1 {
                margin-top: 18px;
                font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 15vw, 3.6rem);
                letter-spacing: -.08em;
            }

            .contact-hero p {
                font-size: .98rem;
            }

            .contact-hero-card {
                display: none;
            }

            .contact-layout {
                width: min(100% - 20px, 1120px);
                margin-top: -66px;
                margin-bottom: 42px;
                gap: 16px;
            }

            .form-card,
            .contact-aside {
                border-radius: 24px;
            }

            .contact-form-grid,
            .contact-proof {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .contact-proof {
                width: min(100% - 20px, 1120px);
                margin: -22px auto 36px;
            }

            .form-card .form-control {
                min-height: 52px;
                border-radius: 14px;
                font-size: 16px;
            }

            .form-card textarea.form-control {
                min-height: 142px;
            }

            .btn-submit {
                min-height: 56px;
                border-radius: 16px;
            }

            .contact-aside-head {
                padding: 24px 22px 22px;
            }

            .contact-info-list {
                padding: 6px 18px 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="contact-page">
    <%- include('partials/navbarUser') %>

    <main class="contact-shell">
        <section class="contact-hero">
            <div class="contact-hero-inner">
                <div>
                    <div class="contact-kicker"><i class="fas fa-bolt"></i> Respuesta comercial directa</div>
                    <h1><span data-i18n="contact_title">Contactanos</span></h1>
                    <p data-i18n="contact_subtitle">Consultá precios, pedí cotización o solicitá asesoramiento técnico. Te ayudamos a resolver la compra con stock, datos claros y seguimiento real.</p>
                </div>
                <aside class="contact-hero-card" aria-label="Respuesta Metal-Ce">
                    <strong>Un equipo, no un bot.</strong>
                    <span>Recibimos tu consulta y la responde una persona de Metal-Ce con la información técnica o comercial que necesitás.</span>
                </aside>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="contact-layout" aria-label="Formulario de contacto">
            <div class="form-card">
                <% if (enviado === true) { %>
                <div class="alert-custom-success">
                    <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
                    <div>
                        <strong data-i18n="contact_success_title">¡Mensaje enviado correctamente!</strong>
                        <span data-i18n="contact_success_msg">Te responderemos a la brevedad. Revisá tu bandeja de entrada.</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <% } %>
                <% if (enviado === false && error) { %>
                <div class="alert-custom-error">
                    <i class="fas fa-exclamation-circle"></i>
                    <div><strong>Error:</strong> <%= error %></div>
                </div>
                <% } %>

                <% if (enviado !== true) { %>
                <form action="/contacto" method="POST">
                    <div class="form-section-title"><i class="fas fa-user"></i> <span data-i18n="contact_your_data">Tus datos</span></div>

                    <div class="contact-form-grid">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label><span data-i18n="contact_fullname">Nombre completo</span> <span class="required-star">*</span></label>
                            <input type="text" class="form-control" name="nombre" placeholder="Juan Garcia" autocomplete="name" required>
                        </div>
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label data-i18n="contact_company">Empresa / Razón social</label>
                            <input type="text" class="form-control" name="empresa" placeholder="Mi Empresa S.A. (opcional)" data-i18n-placeholder="contact_company_ph" autocomplete="organization">
                        </div>
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label>Email <span class="required-star">*</span></label>
                            <input type="email" class="form-control" name="email" placeholder="tu@email.com" autocomplete="email" required>
                        </div>
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label data-i18n="contact_phone">Teléfono</label>
                            <input type="tel" class="form-control" name="telefono" placeholder="+54 9 351 ..." autocomplete="tel">
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-section-title consult-section-title"><i class="fas fa-comment-dots"></i> <span data-i18n="contact_inquiry">Consulta</span></div>

                    <div class="contact-form-grid">
                        <div class="form-group contact-field-full">
                            <label><span data-i18n="contact_inquiry_type">Tipo de consulta</span> <span class="required-star">*</span></label>
                            <select class="form-control" name="tipo_consulta" required>
                                <option value="" data-i18n="contact_select">Seleccioná una opción</option>
                                <option value="Cotización de productos" data-i18n="contact_quote">Cotización de productos</option>
                                <option value="Información técnica" data-i18n="contact_technical">Información técnica</option>
                                <option value="Disponibilidad de stock" data-i18n="contact_stock">Disponibilidad de stock</option>
                                <option value="Condiciones de pago" data-i18n="contact_payment">Condiciones de pago</option>
                                <option value="Otro" data-i18n="contact_other">Otro</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>

                        <div class="form-group contact-field-full">
                            <label><span data-i18n="contact_message">Mensaje</span> <span class="required-star">*</span></label>
                            <textarea class="form-control" name="mensaje" rows="5" placeholder="Contanos producto, cantidad, uso, urgencia o cualquier dato técnico que ayude a cotizar mejor..." data-i18n-placeholder="contact_message_ph" required></textarea>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <p class="required-note"><span data-i18n="contact_required">Los campos marcados con <span class="required-star">*</span> son obligatorios.</span></p>

                    <button type="submit" class="btn-submit">
                        <i class="fas fa-paper-plane"></i><span data-i18n="contact_submit">Enviar consulta</span>
                    </button>
                </form>
                <% } else { %>
                <div class="success-actions">
                    <a href="/" class="btn-submit">
                        <i class="fas fa-home"></i><span data-i18n="contact_back">Volver al inicio</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
                <% } %>
            </div>

            <aside class="contact-aside" aria-label="Datos de contacto Metal-Ce">
                <div class="contact-aside-head">
                    <span>Metal-Ce Córdoba</span>
                    <h2>Compra mejor acompañado.</h2>
                    <p>Tené a mano dirección, horarios y el formulario directo para cerrar tu consulta sin vueltas.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="contact-info-list">
                    <div class="info-pill">
                        <i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt"></i>
                        <div><strong data-i18n="contact_address">Dirección</strong><span>Av. Amadeo Sabattini 8425, Ferreyra, Córdoba</span></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-pill">
                        <i class="fas fa-clock"></i>
                        <div><strong data-i18n="contact_hours">Horarios</strong><span data-i18n="contact_hours_val">Lun-Vie 8-18 | Sáb 8-13</span></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="info-pill">
                        <i class="fas fa-envelope-open-text"></i>
                        <div><strong>Consulta comercial</strong><span><a href="#" onclick="document.querySelector('input[name=nombre]')?.focus(); return false;">Completar formulario</a></span></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </aside>
        </section>

        <section class="contact-proof" aria-label="Ventajas de atención">
            <div class="contact-proof-item"><strong>Stock real</strong><span>Respondemos con disponibilidad clara.</span></div>
            <div class="contact-proof-item"><strong>Asesoramiento técnico</strong><span>Te orientamos por producto y uso.</span></div>
            <div class="contact-proof-item"><strong>Cotización simple</strong><span>Datos ordenados para decidir rápido.</span></div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>

    <script src="https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.5.1.slim.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@popperjs/core@2.9.3/dist/umd/popper.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://stackpath.bootstrapcdn.com/bootstrap/4.5.2/js/bootstrap.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
